ard County","/arc-plc/missouri/stoddard-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs from 1951 to 2025, 75 years. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 10 grids, February to March came in under 90% of normal in 37 of those years, and May to June in 27. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 57% of normal in July to August 2025 and 41% in November to December 2025. So far in 2026 it shows 18% for January to February 2026 and 38% for February to March 2026.</p>"}
